Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Description: weather from Gismeteo, large and on one page
 Погода (Weather) shows the weather now, today and tomorrow in three-hour
 steps and the week ahead for a city of one's choice, from Gismeteo's open
 service. Part of Haltia, a calm touch desktop; it runs on any GTK desktop.
